<header><p class="enc-kicker">Institution</p><h1 class="enc-title">Soviet of the Republics</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1991">1991</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Soviet of the Republics was the upper chamber of the Supreme Soviet of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/soviet-union">Soviet Union</a>, created in September 1991 after the failed August coup, with delegates from the union republics. On 26 December 1991, the day after <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mikhail-gorbachev">Mikhail Gorbachev</a> resigned, it adopted a declaration recognising that the Soviet Union had ceased to exist as a state, formally ending the union.</p></div>
